From: =?utf-8?b?T3R0byBLZWvDpGzDpGluZW4=?= <otto@kekalainen.net>
Date: Mon, 6 Oct 2025 01:40:15 +0000
Subject: Remove tiup client component

Remove the `tiup client` component and its dependencies, specifically
`github.com/gizak/termui/v3` and `github.com/xo/usql` to reduce the dependency
footprint. Any regular MariaDB/MySQL client program can be used so this
component is not mandatory and TiUP will work fine without it.

---
 Makefile                      |   8 +-
 components/client/Makefile    |  97 ----------
 components/client/endpoint.go |  19 --
 components/client/main.go     | 204 --------------------
 go.mod                        |  29 +--
 go.sum                        | 429 ------------------------------------------
 6 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 783 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 components/client/Makefile
 delete mode 100644 components/client/endpoint.go
 delete mode 100644 components/client/main.go

